  "findings": [
    "FLASHINFER_WORKSPACE_BASE controls .cache/flashinfer beneath the supplied project-owned directory. Installed flashinfer_cubin package has priority over FLASHINFER_CUBIN_DIR; existing cubins remain in verified overlay.",
    "FLASHINFER_CUBINS_REPOSITORY is a supported local path. If a requested cubin is absent, download_file first checks local existence, then requests.Session.get receives an absolute filesystem path with no scheme: requests raises MissingSchema; no network URL exists. Source retries four times with5/10/20-second backoff, then returns false; get_cubin returns empty bytes when local cubin remains absent. The native prerequisite must fail if this path is required. A destination lock may be created in the overlay cubin directory; no successful native fallback is assumed.",
    "FLASHINFER_DISABLE_JIT makes any missing AOT module build raise MissingJITCacheError before ninja. No cache/version/checksum bypass is enabled.",
    "TVM_FFI_DISABLE_TORCH_C_DLPACK=1 skips optional torch addon import/build and CUDA probing in that helper. TVM_FFI_CACHE_DIR covers other supported extension cache paths.",
    "CUTE_DSL_DISABLE_FILE_CACHING=1 bypasses loading and dumping hardcoded /tmp/<user>/cutlass_python_cache. KEEP_IR and LOG_TO_FILE remain disabled. Cutlass in-memory compilation, if unexpectedly required, is not claimed verified.",
    "Local immutable model path plus HF_HUB_OFFLINE/TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE prevents model fetch. No remote-code trust is requested. Other optional code paths are not declared exhaustively audited.",
    "Only exact nvidia_cutlass_dsl/python_packages .pth path and hash-audited _cuda_bindings_redirector module are activated by runtime_entry; arbitrary .pth code is never evaluated.",
    "SGLANG_USE_MODELSCOPE=0 disables its alternative downloader; HF modules/datasets caches are project-local and dataset offline is explicit. CUDA_CACHE_MAXSIZE is conservatively set to134217728 bytes; all runtime roots share the500MB budget."
  ]
}
